# <type>[optional scope]: <description>
# e.g. feat(ui): add archive file list
#      fix(sidecar): resolve windows arm64 7za path
#      docs: update 7zz pinning notes
#
# Types: feat, fix, docs, style, refactor, perf, test, build, ci, chore, revert
# Scope (optional, in parens): ui, backend, sidecar, config, docs, release
# - description: imperative, lowercase, no trailing period, <= 72 chars
# - body (optional): why, wrapped at 72 cols
# - footer (optional): BREAKING CHANGE: <what + migration>
# Full spec: https://www.conventionalcommits.org/en/v1.0.0/
